  "prefLabel": "Nuh 105.02 Necessary Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 105.02 Necessary Quorum. A quorum shall be required to hold a meeting, conduct a hearing or receive information of any kind and final decisions shall be made only by the affirmative vote of a majority of the board members eligible to participate in the matter in question.\n\nSource. #7592, eff 11-16-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nuh100-500.html"
